  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of national application of international labour standards through the work of the ILO supervisory bodies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2026 and 2027, the ILO interventions will focus on strengthening the institutional and technical capacity of constituents to effectively close ratification gaps, apply ratified Conventions and Protocols and strengthen tripartite engagement in normative processes including reporting.  Expected results include: Progress made by government and social partners in strengthening tripartite engagement for the ratification and application of international labour standards in line with comments of ILO supervisory bodies and reporting thereon.</narrative>
  </description>
